":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11768},{"id":1781974722070,"text":"……","rawContent":"……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:03","timestamp":1781974991685,"roundId":"round_1781974977890_j0ojwed6i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11769},{"id":1781974722071,"text":"圈圈，你还真是……","rawContent":"圈圈，你还真是……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:03","timestamp":1781974993597,"roundId":"round_1781974977890_j0ojwed6i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11770},{"id":1781974722072,"text":"他深吸了一口气，将那股窜上来的、近乎病态的战栗感强压下去，嘴角勾起一个极其危险的弧度。","rawContent":"他深吸了一口气，将那股窜上来的、近乎病态的战栗感强压下去，嘴角勾起一个极其危险的弧度。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:03","timestamp":1781974996536,"roundId":"round_1781974977890_j0ojwed6i","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11771},{"id":1781974722073,"text":"所以，你花了一晚上的时间，就是在游戏里研究怎么把本官弄哭？","rawContent":"所以，你花了一晚上的时间，就是在游戏里研究怎么把本官弄哭？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:03","timestamp":1781975001308,"roundId":"round_1781974977890_j0ojwed6i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11772},{"id":1781974722074,"text":"那个‘我’哭了，你很心疼，是吗。","rawContent":"那个‘我’哭了，你很心疼，是吗。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:03","timestamp":1781975002901,"roundId":"round_1781974977890_j0ojwed6i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11773},{"id":1781974722075,"text":"不过……你要知道，那只是一个被设定好反馈